%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0fd4c3c83fae23b4cae61c12ce438472, type: 3}
  m_Name: Botanist
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Botanist
  defaultPath:
    pathName: Introduction
    paragraphs:
    - Well hi there! Not often you meet a stranger in this town...
    - Oh, you are our new farmer? Then we are going to get along just fine!
    - Come visit my stall sometime if you are ever running low on seeds! I try to
      be there a little bit after dawn.
    emotions: 010000000400000000000000
  repeatedItemPath:
    pathName: Again...?
    paragraphs:
    - Oh joy.... {itemName}.... Again....  {itemGiven}
    emotions: 03000000
  paths:
  - pathName: Buy something!
    paragraphs:
    - Find something that interests you?
    - If you show me some seeds, I would be happy to give you some details about
      them!
    emotions: 0400000001000000
  - pathName: Want to buy this?
    paragraphs:
    - I see you looking at the {storeItemName}. Its yours for {storeItemValue} <color=#E0D38F>Mints</color>
      <sprite index=0>! {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 00000000
  - pathName: Sold!
    paragraphs:
    - Make good use of that! {itemBought} {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: No Money
    paragraphs:
    - Hey, you aren't trying to pull a fast one on me, are ya?
    emotions: 03000000
  - pathName: No Space
    paragraphs:
    - Woah now, you can barely fit this in your pockets! Come again when you have
      more room.
    emotions: 05000000
  - pathName: Want To Trade for this?
    paragraphs:
    - One {storeItemName} coming right up! I just need a few things first. {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Not Enough Items
    paragraphs:
    - Hey, you aren't trying to pull a fast one on me, are ya?
    emotions: 03000000
  - pathName: Have some Seeds
    paragraphs:
    - Since you are just starting out, I will lend you some of these Timber Ear seeds!
      {freezePlayer}
    - They are really low maintenance, and most of the local fauna tend to ignore
      them. {givePlayerItems}
    - Timber Ear consumes a hefty chunk of nutrients, so make sure to not plant in
      the same spot twice!
    emotions: 010000000000000002000000
  - pathName: Trellis Explanaition
    paragraphs:
    - Quick thing before you buy, farmer! That plant is going to need a trellis if
      you want it to grow. {freezePlayer}
    - The trellis will block your movement a bit, but it allows the crops to continue
      producing even after they are harvested!
    - You can buy a trellis from me, or have the Craftsman make some for you.
    emotions: 050000000000000000000000
  fillerPaths:
  - pathName: Hard Work
    paragraphs:
    - I gotta say, I don't quite envy your position.
    - Having to work that close to the mist must be very frightening.
    emotions: 0400000000000000
  - pathName: Mist is neat
    paragraphs:
    - Can you believe plants used to take several months to mature??
    - I could never imagine a world like that. Farming would be so boring!
    emotions: 0500000001000000
  - pathName: Come to my store
    paragraphs:
    - Please stop at my little shop booth when I am there! I can sell you some seeds
      that I happen to come across, as well as my bagged fertilizers.
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Ichor Explanation
    paragraphs:
    - Some crops require a special nutrient known as Ichor. Unlike the other nutrients,
      plants do not produce it, nor have I found a way to condense it into a fertilizer.
    - I have traced high concentrations of Ichor in living creatures... Perhaps if
      I could get a sample...
    emotions: 0000000005000000
  - pathName: Seed Explanation
    paragraphs:
    - There are many plants that have special properties to them.
    - If you have any questions, show me the crop seeds and I can tell you more about
      them!
    emotions: 0000000001000000
  - pathName: Nutrient Explanation
    paragraphs:
    - Have you been mixing up where you plant your seeds?
    - It helps to rotate your crops to better suite your soil and keep the nutrients
      high.
    - Or if that is too much of an ask, you can just use my fertalizer!
    - I highly recommend the second option.
    emotions: 04000000060000000000000001000000
  questPaths:
  - pathName: Pollen Explanaition
    paragraphs:
    - Quick thing before you buy, farmer! That plant is going to need some pollination
      if you want it to grow. {freezePlayer}
    - There are some moths out on your farm that I reckon would do the trick! Use
      your torch to get their attention and guide them to your crops once they are
      almost grown!
    emotions: 0500000000000000
  itemRecievedPaths:
  - pathName: Go Sell that
    paragraphs:
    - Excellent harvest farmer! Glad to know the plants are in good hands.
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Looks Great
    paragraphs:
    - 'Perfect, I have been starving all day! Thanks a bunch.

      {itemGiven}'
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Too Full
    paragraphs:
    - Oh, I positively couldn't have another.
    - If you have extras, go share them with everyone!
    emotions: 0500000001000000
  itemSpecificRemarks:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - I don't have much use for something like that.
    - If you are looking to sell your stuff, I bet that weird wagon fellow will purchase
      it.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  - pathName: Fertilizer
    paragraphs:
    - That stuff is real handy for when you have a plot of land that just can't support
      any life.
    - One bag will fill up any tile of ground with its specified nutrient.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  - pathName: CarrotSeeds
    paragraphs:
    - Pale carrots are a very well rounded crop. Not too picky, and don't take much
      time to grow.
    - The difficult part is keeping them safe from the hares. They seem to have it
      out for pale carrots, and will prioritize eating them over anything else.
    emotions: 0000000002000000
  - pathName: TuberSeeds
    paragraphs:
    - While TerraTubers aren't too valuable on their own, it has the chance to produce
      multiple upon harvest.
    - They are not very appetizing, but in times like these, we take what we can
      get.
    emotions: 0000000002000000
  - pathName: DrakeSeeds
    paragraphs:
    - Mandrakes are a nasty bunch. They aren't harmful, but they are such a pain
      to chase down!
    - Makes me thankful none of the other plants here fight back...
    emotions: 0300000001000000
  - pathName: StalkSeeds
    paragraphs:
    - Gloomstalk has been a staple crop for the town for years! It's versatility
      and quick growth are unparalleled.
    - Keep an eye on their water intake and you will have a field of Gloomstalk in
      no time.
    emotions: 0100000000000000
  - pathName: BeanSeeds
    paragraphs:
    - Unlike most plants, BloodBeans continue to grow after harvest if left in the
      soil.
    - Keep its ichor levels steady to ensure multiple yields.
    emotions: 0000000000000000
  - pathName: GingerSeeds
    paragraphs:
    - Personally, I could never get these to grow. This plant is very picky regarding
      its growing conditions, and requires constant maintenance.
    - However, there is merit in a succesful yield. With how rare these roots are,
      they fetch a high price.
    emotions: 0400000005000000
  - pathName: Scroll
    paragraphs:
    - Now thats a nice drawing you got there! I have never seen a flower like that
      before.
    - You sure do have a vivid imagination!
    emotions: 0500000001000000
  friendshipPath1: []
  friendshipPath2: []
  friendshipPath3: []
  alreadySpoken:
  - pathName: ...
    paragraphs:
    - '...

'
    emotions: 06000000
  branchingPaths: []
  questCompletePaths:
  - pathName: Default Quest Complete
    paragraphs:
    - Thanks a million!
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Grow Quest Complete
    paragraphs:
    - What an amazing harvest! This will keep us fed for a good while.
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Timber Ear Quest Completed
    paragraphs:
    - See? I told you growing Timber Ear was easy work!
    - Now I will let you in on a little secret...
    - Mr. Wagon Man pays next to NOTHING for these things! You are much better off
      taking these to the Craftsman.
    emotions: 010000000000000003000000
  - pathName: Pollen Quest Completed
    paragraphs:
    - Great work! Those Lumen Moths sure are handy little helpers, arent they??
    - Here, take this. With this post, you can start harvesting the nectar they produce!
    - Think of it like a cute little inn for the moths!
    emotions: 050000000000000001000000
  dailyQuestPaths:
  - pathName: Daily Quest
    paragraphs:
    - Perfect timing! I was hoping you could help me out with something. {freezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Grow Quest
    paragraphs:
    - Just the farmer I was in need of! The town is running low on food, and my plant
      beds just aren't cutting it. {freezePlayer}
    - If you could grow me these crops real soon, it would be highly appreciated.
    emotions: 0500000001000000
  - pathName: Hunt Quest
    paragraphs:
    - These vile vermin have made a mockery of my personal garden! {freezePlayer}
    - Make them pay Mr.Farmer! Let it rain ichor!
    emotions: 0300000003000000
